# Review routing for warp (spec §8.5, OBI-181 design §5). Approval rights
# per path class follow the tier matrix (spec §5.11.2 "Write, via review"):
#   domain live content   a lead of that domain, or an arch
#   protected code        an arch (another arch for an arch's change)
#   /secure, CI, owners   a root (another root/arch for a root's change)
#
# Phase 2 posture (OBI-181 Q-B3.2): the GitHub teams below do not exist
# yet and reviews come from the loom-reviewer App, which GitHub does not
# accept as a code owner. The rules are therefore written down but
# commented out, and branch protection does not require code-owner review.
# To activate: create the teams with members who can review, uncomment,
# then turn on "Require review from Code Owners" for main.
#
# *                     @LoomMud/archs
# /domains/             @LoomMud/archs
# /domains/forest/      @LoomMud/domain-forest-leads @LoomMud/archs
# /domains/start/       @LoomMud/domain-start-leads @LoomMud/archs
# /domains/test/        @LoomMud/domain-test-leads @LoomMud/archs
# /std/                 @LoomMud/archs
# /cmds/                @LoomMud/archs
# /daemons/             @LoomMud/archs
# /include/             @LoomMud/archs
# /doc/                 @LoomMud/archs
# /secure/              @LoomMud/roots
# /.github/             @LoomMud/roots
